UPDATE public.economics_cases SET tactical_explanations = ARRAY['TRUE — On the Fuhrmann definition used in the entrance exam, the sentence is correct. A firm''s inventory turnover and asset turnover can move in different directions in the same year if inventory management improves while overall investment in non-current assets expands.

